  "description": "A .NET library that reduces friction when using JWT in your applications by handling signing credentials\n    with automatic key rotation and JWK/JWKS management (RSA, ECDSA, HMAC) — without requiring you to implement an OAuth2 server.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
